flowchart TD
    A[Model score is produced for the same target] --> B{Which error hurts more?}
    B -- False negative hurts more --> C[Include borderline cases in the review queue]
    B -- False positive hurts more --> D[Hold borderline cases out of the queue]
    C --> E[Interpret the threshold to reduce misses]
    D --> F[Interpret the threshold to reduce over-detection]
